      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/17/costa-rica-journalist-camilo-rodriguez-shot-dead",
      "description": "<p>Camilo Rodriguez’s death comes as the country grapples with a surge in drug violence </p><p>The Costa Rican journalist Camilo Rodríguez, who gained prominence for publishing allegations against ⁠suspected drug traffickers and politicians, was shot dead on Monday, authorities said.</p><p>The first known killing of a journalist ⁠in Costa Rica in ⁠25 years, ​Rodriguez’s death comes as the country grapples with a surge in drug violence driven by international trafficking groups, despite long ⁠being regarded as one of Central America’s most peaceful and stable democracies.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/17/costa-rica-journalist-camilo-rodriguez-shot-dead\">Continue reading...</a>",
